Evolution of this type of sleep in marine mammals and so we mammals can afford we

00:16:43.570 --> 00:16:47.129
Sort of land mammals can afford to sleep with our whole brain

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:51.780
Yeah, it's it seems that there there must be some trade-off

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:59.010
For being able to sleep this way, otherwise. I I would expect it to be much more common in the animal

