One thing to keep in mind is that sleep may have had an initial

00:18:53.050 --> 00:18:55.050
primordial function

00:18:55.330 --> 00:18:58.710
perhaps in these coral or other simple organisms

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:01.800
But that once an animal was

00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:06.479
Sleeping and as they became more complex other functions may

00:19:07.210 --> 00:19:09.540
accumulated during the course of evolution so

